# pk-fixes-tests done flag
Completed: 2026-07-29

## Fixes applied

### Fix 1: Customer order track endpoint + JWT customer support
- `jwt.strategy.ts`: added CUSTOMER role branch — validates against `customer` table instead of `user` table
- `orders.service.ts`: added `findOneForTracking(orderId, customerId)` — verifies customer owns order, returns track shape
- `orders.controller.ts`: added `GET :id/track` endpoint using JwtAuthGuard (CUSTOMER JWT accepted)
- `order/[orderId]/page.tsx`: on mount, tries localStorage first for instant render, then fetches `/orders/:id/track` with customer_token; graceful degradation on 401/network error

### Fix 2: Customer login FK error
- `auth.service.ts`: added `NotFoundException` import; added restaurant existence check before any customer upsert — throws `NotFoundException("Restaurant not found")` if restaurant doesn't exist, preventing P2003

### Fix 3: Order number collision
- `orders.service.ts`: replaced `Math.floor(1000 + Math.random() * 9000)` with `Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,6).toUpperCase()` for stronger entropy; wrapped transaction in retry-on-P2002 pattern

### Fixes 4-7: Already implemented
- Fix 4 (session cleanup): already present in auth.service.ts lines 67-73
- Fix 5 (analytics IST timezone): already present in analytics.service.ts
- Fix 6 (customer totalOrders/totalSpent): already present inside $transaction in orders.service.ts
- Fix 7 (customer totalAmount alias): already present in customers.service.ts

## Tests

### Setup
- Installed: jest@^29, @types/jest@^29, ts-jest@^29, supertest@^7, @types/supertest@^6
- Created: `jest.config.js` with ts-jest transform, `src` rootDir
- Added test scripts to package.json: `test`, `test:watch`, `test:cov`

### Test files written
- `src/auth/auth.service.spec.ts` — 8 cases: login (valid, wrong password, unknown email, inactive, bad body), refresh (valid, not found, expired), customerLogin (restaurant not found, new phone, existing phone, missing field)
- `src/orders/orders.service.spec.ts` — 6 cases: 2-item order pricing, flat discount, percent discount, GST, customer stats increment, invalid menuItemId
- `src/payments/payments.service.spec.ts` — 4 cases: full payment → PAID, partial payment → PARTIAL, already refunded → BadRequest, valid refund → creates REFUND- record
- `src/analytics/analytics.service.spec.ts` — 4 cases: customer.count used (not user), cancelled excluded from revenue, cancelled excluded from count, correct return shape
- `src/menu/menu.service.spec.ts` — 4 cases: has items → BadRequest, 0 items → delete + success, not found → NotFound, wrong restaurant → Forbidden

